<title>USA: Shell forms C02 operating company.</title>
<headline>Shell forms C02 operating company.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Continental Cos, formerly known as  Shell Western E&amp;P Inc, said Friday it has formed Shell C02 Co as its  business unit for managing and marketing C02 supplies and applied  technology.</p>
<p>The Royal Dutch/Shell Group subsidiary said Tim Bradley, previously  manager of C02 marketing, will serve as the company's president, responsible  for all aspects of C02 marketing, engineering and production operations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
